Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well,\Nso let's stay with the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our radar is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the many roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That comes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow is waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well,\Nso let's see when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.56,0:01:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,our minds will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams And you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, the tiny ripples\Nall over the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,became a tidal wave before anyone noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We got an arm still with it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope that's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to call\Nthe bastards all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but they won't pick up the damn snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:02:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rookies we ran into back\Non Sabo Odi formed an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, whatever it is, it can't be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't Flamingo resign,\Nbut it doesn't say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, contact everyone we know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they find out about\Nour alliance so quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the reporter? Opsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him Some freelancer,\Nhe's gotten a ton of scoops lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about our alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the other news that troubles me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and trafalgar bastards—so you're\Nlooking to take on one of the emperors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,same as us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I wonder which\None are you aiming for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:03:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,me—I resigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.74,0:04:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy, he picked up finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,now what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave this to law!\NHello? This is Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy here, and I'm gonna be\Nking of the pirates! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You do this every time! Hey! Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Caesar's boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that guy really sucks, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He did bad stuff to kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give him back since\Nthat's what we promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he does that again, we'll\Nkick his ass twice as hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And yours too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After your brother Ace died,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew disappeared for two years.\NWhat were you doing all that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'm keeping it a\Nsecret from you at least
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've actually been quite eager to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something that will interest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Something you'll want very\Nbadly, I'm quite certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of amazing super meat\Nlike I've never tasted before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's toying with you, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's a whole bunch of meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give him an edge,\Neven if it is meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're handing over Caesar to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No more, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's for your\Nown good as much as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know what will happen\Nif you try to run away with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be a happy ending for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No meat, no meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to\Nspeak to my business partner a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to confirm he's nice and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joker, I'm so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You resigned from the\NWarlords all because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet eight hours from now\Non an island north of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave Caesar waiting for you\Nthere at three in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:06:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick him up and this unpleasant\Nbusiness will finally be over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we could sit down for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang up already, Kudlik.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They almost had me wrapped\Nup in his meat spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't specify how many\Ncrewmates he can bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's a big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he brings a whole army to the meeting\Npoint, then we're screwed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Handing over Caesar is just a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If it draws a ton of his resources,\Nthat might even benefit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you mean, if more people\Ncome to the trade-off,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then less people will be\Nguarding the Smile Factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.73,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, can we find the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not looking for\Na needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for a factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's guaranteed to be big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get there, we'll find it\Nsuper easy. My lasers will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Care of the red, unfortunately I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,have intel on everything but the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,factory no surprise really sounds\Nlike it's their biggest asset
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We might need to think outside\Nthe box. We're going to Greenbit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but not the island of dress Rosa\Nitself that's most unfortunate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we're still docking the ship\Naddress rosa just calm down have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you been to this dress nana place\Nbefore what was it like dress
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,rosa i've never been there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry do flamingo owns the place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I always do,\NI bet Mingo Kingdom's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna be crazy after\Nthat we should swing by
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Make things up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:07:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going in there\Nblind, we have to have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:07:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something about meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And milk for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't like bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I cannot divulge\Nwhy we were being pursued.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I will say that our original\Ndestination was a place called Zoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoe? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it, Sir Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a rather convenient coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After I hand off Caesar, and destroyed\Nthe Smile Factory like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoe was going to be the\Nnext stop on my trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, would it be possible to accompany\Nyou there after our current mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all go to Wano! Very cool! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke and three brave\Nsamurai, including myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,were headed to Zoe before\Nour ship was sadly destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Momonosuke, and another samurai\Nmanaged to make it to Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Once there, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We were assaulted by Doflamingo\Nand his villainous troop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Panicked, I took refuge on a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A dire mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I met some children\Nbeing taken to Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I shared in their terrible fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I had no idea what I\Nwas in store for at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Momonosuke! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrounded and quite\Ndesperate to follow the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I relied on the brave\Nassistance of my fellow Samadai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjino.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare Mata-koth for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for his sacrifice,\Nit all would have been lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply cannot leave him to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I must return to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real brother, Kanjuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, we'll help you save him.\NNo props. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick to our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there are pirates who are excused of their
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,crimes by order of the\Nworld government itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In return they provide us with two things:\Noverwhelming strength and intimidation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, although they\Nmay be fearsome criminals,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the world government weaponizes their\Nprowess to keep other pirates in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the world's greatest\Nswordsman, Hawkeye Dracule Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Dressrosa and\Nthe devilish puppeteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The heavenly demon,\NDon Quixote Dothamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the Navy's human weapon,\Nthe tyrant, Bartholomew Kumar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruler of Amazon Lily,\NPirate Empress, Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A member of the worst generation, and the\Nmastermind behind the Rocky Port incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The surgeon of death, Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, the founder and chief commander\Nof the Pirate Dispatch Organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A former crewmate of Roger,\Nwhose fame continues to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The genius jester, Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those six, along with the\Nother guy, are warlords!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That changed this morning\Nrather unexpectedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know why, but Doflamingo quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Law's under investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we might have\Nto expel him from the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We need them to help balance the power\Nbetween the four emperors and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Brand New.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all on the same page here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let Law and Straw\NHat make a mess of things on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I already had Smoker from G5\Nscreaming my ear off in his last report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I said enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I said in, Fuji Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't abandon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him, Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master has a plan, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope it involves a lot of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Navy, let's throw down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to speculate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Baby Five, looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:13:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that crowd, they look mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet the whole world's going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I heard the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you got him killed, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever heard of personal space?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Annoying? But?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Annoying, but? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You like me! Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you drop this already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master was calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants you to bring...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta pick your fiancés better, or\NDuffy's just gonna keep killing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know who Duffy\Ndoesn't want to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know who's single one\Nwould make a good husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Also me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just yanking your chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You really need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind. Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The Colosseum is packed as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work, Diamante.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The credit is all yours, Duffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This country owes everything\Nto its beloved king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Beloved?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite fond of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You make it sound like I'm\Nthe hero of the Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty as charged! A hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless and invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't hear me say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I grabbed the thing you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy, Duffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too close. Too close?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When Straw Hat finds out about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll do anything to get it;\Nthen he'll be mine to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And his new friend law will\Nbe dragged down with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,diamante—I'm going to entrust this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly; it's\Nfar too important—it's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know exactly what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to do Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me sound\Nlike some kind of genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only entrust this to\Na genius like you. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty as charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A genius that will dispose\Nof that fool's Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't hear me say it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to resist this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The source of his late brother's\Npower, the flame flame fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't dare let anyone get\Ntheir hands on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looming on the horizon\Nis their destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dress Rosa, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dopo Bingo's gonna hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry nuts, we're coming! Catch it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Known as a land of love and\Npassion, this is Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready for us, Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to keep it down, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're deep in enemy\Nterritory, you know? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got the tests in, and guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:16:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm extra super!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we find that factory,\Nthen I'll let my lasers rip! Boo! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, enough with the yelling, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not going to town!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I cannot fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you can't fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you do it back\Nin that garbage shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I don't—I have no\Nclue what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying; he flew for real,\Nbut he doesn't have wings, surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I would recall that, and even\Nif I could fly, I can't now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did then then what's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It matters not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, I will never do\Nsuch a dreadful thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,won't fly; you can't make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid of heights or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,what How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a brilliant samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing in this\Nentire world that I fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and hop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, he's only eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I say it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the\Npirates all day! Ha! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be the shogun of Wano someday\NAnd you'll be in the war beneath my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're a worm or a eel,\Nthen you're a monkey, you ape!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the wood monkeys are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Bobanosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe him our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy, please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a samurai, but he is\Nstill young and lacks restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps you could show some restraint in\Ndealing with children, for all our sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:19:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's such a little coward,\Nmaybe he shouldn't talk so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he picking on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's their problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You samurai are a bunch\Nof lechers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your tongue, knave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kinemar, let's head to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we pervert, uh, I mean convert\Nour clothes so we don't stand out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In Dressrosa, this fashion is\Nparticularly important for women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to produce appropriate costumes\Nso that we may enter the town safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to like\Nthis Dressrosa place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Better take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It might come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a VIVRA card?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take you to that place\Ncalled Zoe I mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoe is going to be the\Nnext stop on my trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to us on\NDressrosa, go straight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be fine. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A map one of my crew members made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is where we're at,\Nthe west coast of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flamingo's palace is at the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be responsible\Nfor handing over Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pass through Dressrosa until\Nwe get to the northern shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There we'll cross a long bridge\Nto the island of Greenbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to cross\NDressrosa to get to an island?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We could just take the ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get me there safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:21:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the Sunny security\Nteam, be wary of enemy attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have to be our decoy. Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We might engage in combat? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought guarding duty\Nwould be the safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we are in enemy territory, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's okay, because\Nwe've got Sanji to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's team is gone, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the key to this whole plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They better not blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, forget about that for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to protect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who travel here\Nmay find their hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,enchanted by any number of\Nthe kingdom's many wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, the fields of\Nbeautiful, fragrant flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the enticing\Naroma of local cuisine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After dinner, beautiful women and\Npassionate dancers may catch your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And most remarkable of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mario! Bad Dog! Bad Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a toy! I need that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the stuffing comes out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All this money's giving me a side stitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And my stuffing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.88,0:22:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a strange sight that awestruck
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,visitors cannot see\Nanywhere else in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a friendly neighborhood\Nsoldier. Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:22:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we met somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.76,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in today's paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.58,0:23:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My strings got all tangled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A toy or a dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As if it were nothing peculiar at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There are toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Living alongside humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Only outsiders seem perplexed\Nby these colorful citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, passion and toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance together in the streets\Nhere in the port town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man's been stabbed in the streets!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some maniac on the loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:23:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just very passionate women.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.72,0:24:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're the jealous type, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.48,0:24:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So if their lover cheats\Non them, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,things get a little violent. A little?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like the pretty ones\Nare especially stabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, the toys are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over it now. Come on, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy we cannot afford to whittle away\Nthe hours in this place time is short.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a citricongenal promptly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.04,0:24:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa relax, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.14,0:24:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we gotta move quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go running around blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.08,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta gather info first
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.90,0:24:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't this fishy to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the country abdicated\Nhis throne this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of figured this place would be\Nin chaos, but nobody seems to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they haven't heard the news yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.44,0:25:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ask him, hey pups—stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.88,0:25:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were on the front\Npage of the newspaper today!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,today
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your order has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I think it has! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.38,0:25:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh shrimp Paulie...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Roast squid ink pasta...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And fairy pumpkin gazpacho!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.14,0:25:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.26,0:25:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is a fairy pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,in this country, many people still\Nbelieve in old legends about fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.66,0:25:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.52,0:25:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,More like people see fairies. Or do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,On the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.01,0:25:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fascinating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.98,0:25:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been that way for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.06,0:26:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Although most of us have never\Nseen them, we all know they exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you know what people call them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They call them the guardian\Ndeities of Chris Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.64,0:26:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, would you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.34,0:26:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He got it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 14 times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.22,0:26:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The party?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.13,0:26:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what their deal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.24,0:26:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a roulette table.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go black for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I win or lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.32,0:26:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Black 20, you lose again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,White again, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.76,0:26:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Another black, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.74,0:26:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disgrace to the Don Quixote\Nname seems like all my luck ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.58,0:26:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good at all. Give\Nup, you had enough, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.40,0:27:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can really clean up\Nwith Buffalo isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.28,0:27:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeping an eye on us, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No joking, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.98,0:27:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One last time, I'll bet\Neverything I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.94,0:27:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You pick whatever color catches\Nyour fancy, and I'll take the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, of course, I'll bet\Neverything I've got as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.40,0:27:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be feeling lucky today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.84,0:27:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Place your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything on white, if you would, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're set on choosing\Nwhite, I got only one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything on black.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, white, win big!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It landed on White, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.60,0:27:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:28:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some news to\Nbring to you, old timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's White.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the dealer here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.42,0:28:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should get\Nyour eyes checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.54,0:28:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look more carefully this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.10,0:28:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's White.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.26,0:28:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.40,0:28:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.31,0:28:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep your mouth\Nshut and mind your own business?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.55,0:28:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he wants his ass kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.32,0:28:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does this guy think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.80,0:28:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he know who they work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.64,0:28:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Got himself involved again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't pulling my\Nleg when you said I won?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.40,0:28:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you made off like a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.86,0:28:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I don't know who you\Nare or where you came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.52,0:28:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but thank you for acting as my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just calling it like I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.54,0:28:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You made the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.88,0:28:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you don't look like you\Nneed help defending yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have stuck your\Nhead where it doesn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say it landed on black,\Nthen it landed on black.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.38,0:28:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't see anyway, so what difference\Ndoes it make what color I say it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.06,0:28:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We run this joint. You\Ngot that. They left me no
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.82,0:28:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,choice i'm gonna have to\Nsend every one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.44,0:29:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am i so happy
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.15,0:29:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.56,0:29:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And how'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.38,0:29:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that is one big hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a curse to be blind\Nin this world of crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere you turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there's bound to be horrendous things\Nhardly worth laying your eyes upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.32,0:29:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not seeing them is a true blessing.
